#: ../../source/example_gallery/modal_analysis.rst:2
#: 3cad1ac48de349c2a16b67e374f27bcc
msgid "Modal Analysis"
msgstr "模态分析"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/modal_analysis.rst:4
#: bddcfd6df2104a32a3d4e6affbbc6d8a
msgid ""
"Two examples that solve **generalized eigenproblems** instead of driven "
"systems — one photonic, one structural. Both follow the same recipe: "
"assemble two (or three) matrices with the builtin assemblers, hand them to a"
" shift-invert sparse eigensolver, and read physical frequencies / "
"propagation constants off the spectrum:"
msgstr ""
"两个求解\\ **广义特征值问题**\\ "
"而非受迫系统的示例——一个光子学，一个结构力学。两者遵循相同的流程：使用内置装配器装配两个（或三个）矩阵，将其交给位移-"
"逆稀疏特征值求解器，并从频谱中读取物理频率/传播常数："

#: ../../source/example_gallery/modal_analysis.rst:14
#: b9e5f9bb9f904e099f9f8c15dc4368b3
msgid ""
"Each validates against a closed-form reference (Marcatili's slab "
"approximation, Euler-Bernoulli beam theory)."
msgstr "每个示例均与闭合形式参考解进行验证（Marcatili 平板近似、欧拉-伯努利梁理论）。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/modal_analysis.rst:19
#: 03717ff3d1ae4ed9bc75497b2b7c1270
msgid "Rectangular waveguide modes (photonics)"
msgstr "矩形波导模式（光子学）"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/modal_analysis.rst:21
#: cbb17250e75b4aa0be922b4a77dc2c74
msgid ""
"``examples/wave/wave_guide_mode/waveguide_modes.py`` computes the guided "
"modes of a rectangular dielectric waveguide from its 2D cross-section. In "
"the weakly-guiding scalar approximation the transverse field :math:`E(x,y)` "
"and propagation constant :math:`\\beta` satisfy"
msgstr ""
"``examples/wave/wave_guide_mode/waveguide_modes.py`` "
"从其二维截面计算矩形介质波导的导波模式。在弱导标量近似下，横向电场 :math:`E(x,y)` 和传播常数 :math:`\\beta` 满足"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/modal_analysis.rst:26
#: 090c7ded299046f3a0c818ff45427e90
msgid "\\big(K - k_0^2 M_\\varepsilon\\big)\\,E \\;=\\; -\\beta^2\\, M\\,E,"
msgstr "\\big(K - k_0^2 M_\\varepsilon\\big)\\,E \\;=\\; -\\beta^2\\, M\\,E,"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/modal_analysis.rst:30
#: 63654ba027694698b0fb60bc2c85e1aa
msgid ""
"built from three builtins — stiffness "
"(:class:`~tensormesh.LaplaceElementAssembler`), mass "
"(:class:`~tensormesh.MassElementAssembler`), and the index-weighted mass "
":math:`M_\\varepsilon = \\int n^2\\,\\phi_i\\phi_j` "
"(:class:`~tensormesh.assemble.ScaledMassElementAssembler`). A mode is guided"
" when its effective index :math:`n_{\\text{eff}} = \\beta/k_0` falls between"
" the cladding and core indices; the default geometry (:math:`18 \\times 14` "
"µm core, :math:`n = 1.450/1.444`, :math:`\\lambda_0 = 1.55` µm) carries "
"seven guided modes, and the computed effective indices agree with "
"Marcatili's separable slab approximation to :math:`\\sim 10^{-4}`."
msgstr ""
"由三个内置装配器构建——刚度矩阵（\\ :class:`~tensormesh.LaplaceElementAssembler`\\ ）、质量矩阵（\\"
" :class:`~tensormesh.MassElementAssembler`\\ ），以及折射率加权质量矩阵 "
":math:`M_\\varepsilon = \\int n^2\\,\\phi_i\\phi_j`\\ （\\ "
":class:`~tensormesh.assemble.ScaledMassElementAssembler`\\ ）。当模式的有效折射率 "
":math:`n_{\\text{eff}} = \\beta/k_0` 介于包层与纤芯折射率之间时，该模式为导波模式；默认几何参数（\\ "
":math:`18 \\times 14` µm 纤芯，\\ :math:`n = 1.450/1.444`\\ ，\\ "
":math:`\\lambda_0 = 1.55` µm）支持七个导波模式，计算所得有效折射率与 Marcatili 可分离平板近似一致至 "
":math:`\\sim 10^{-4}`\\ 。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/modal_analysis.rst:42
#: 582d81d733e64c4dacb43a8f000ecf8e
msgid "Guided transverse modes of a rectangular dielectric waveguide"
msgstr "矩形介质波导的导波横向模式"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/modal_analysis.rst:46
#: ef39e7e1de5241898d5a0a08d2c67515
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The guided transverse fields :math:`E_{pq}` (red/blue = field sign, core "
"outlined), labelled by their lobe counts along :math:`x` and :math:`y` — the"
" fundamental :math:`E_{11}`, the dipole pair :math:`E_{21}/E_{12}`, and the "
"higher-order modes."
msgstr ""
"导波横向电场 :math:`E_{pq}`\\ （红/蓝表示场符号，纤芯轮廓勾勒），按沿 :math:`x` 和 :math:`y` "
"方向的瓣数标记——基模 :math:`E_{11}`\\ 、偶极子对 :math:`E_{21}/E_{12}`\\ ，以及高阶模式。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/modal_analysis.rst:53
#: 06df131e3e8440bfa004f82b21cd1aab
msgid "Cantilever beam vibration (structural)"
msgstr "悬臂梁振动（结构力学）"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/modal_analysis.rst:55
#: e72390f6f1224a99b4d0e5e519c38496
msgid ""
"``examples/solid/beam_vibration_analysis/vibration_cylinder.py`` runs the "
"classic free-vibration analysis of a clamped-free steel cylinder (:math:`L ="
" 1` m, :math:`R = 25` mm) in 3D linear elasticity:"
msgstr ""
"``examples/solid/beam_vibration_analysis/vibration_cylinder.py`` 对固支-"
"自由钢圆柱（\\ :math:`L = 1` m，\\ :math:`R = 25` mm）进行经典三维线弹性自由振动分析："

#: ../../source/example_gallery/modal_analysis.rst:59
#: 2af98ba864204af48452ce437a54bfab
msgid "K\\,\\phi = \\omega^2 M\\,\\phi,"
msgstr "K\\,\\phi = \\omega^2 M\\,\\phi,"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/modal_analysis.rst:63
#: 8b0c5066e4de446ab9ba762e13214d07
msgid ""
"with :math:`K` from :class:`~tensormesh.LinearElasticityElementAssembler` "
"and the consistent vector mass built from the scalar mass matrix "
"(:math:`M_{\\text{vec}} = \\rho\\, M_{\\text{scalar}} \\otimes I_3`). The "
"clamped base is removed by the usual :class:`~tensormesh.Condenser` mask. On"
" top of the modes, a **modal FRF** — the tip response to a transverse tip "
"force with 1% modal damping — shows the resonance/antiresonance structure."
msgstr ""
"其中 :math:`K` 来自 :class:`~tensormesh.LinearElasticityElementAssembler`\\ "
"，一致向量质量矩阵由标量质量矩阵构建（\\ :math:`M_{\\text{vec}} = \\rho\\, M_{\\text{scalar}} "
"\\otimes I_3`\\ ）。固支端通过常规的 :class:`~tensormesh.Condenser` 掩码去除。在模态分析之上，\\ "
"**模态频响函数**——横向尖端力作用下含 1% 模态阻尼的尖端响应——展示了共振/反共振结构。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/modal_analysis.rst:72
#: 5b0e4a98321141a491f509979cd9b23c
msgid ""
"The first bending frequency comes out at **37.2 Hz** vs Euler-Bernoulli "
"theory's 36.2 Hz (+3% with P1 tets, converging with refinement); because the"
" section is circular, every bending mode arrives as a near-degenerate pair "
"(two orthogonal bending planes), followed by the first torsion and axial "
"modes."
msgstr ""
"第一阶弯曲频率计算结果为 **37.2 Hz**\\ ，而欧拉-伯努利理论值为 36.2 Hz（P1 四面体单元偏高 "
"3%，随网格加密收敛）；由于截面为圆形，每阶弯曲模式均以近简并模态对形式出现（两个正交弯曲平面），随后为第一阶扭转和轴向模式。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/modal_analysis.rst:78
#: 616d3a79c0a4421bb1d138120e56cab8
msgid "Cantilever cylinder mode shapes"
msgstr "悬臂圆柱模态振型"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/modal_analysis.rst:82
#: 687b0a966b604ae78d485f1874512923
msgid ""
"Deformed mode shapes (displacement magnitude, exaggerated): the bending "
"pairs, first torsion, and first axial mode."
msgstr "变形模态振型（位移幅值，已 exaggerate）：弯曲模态对、第一阶扭转和第一阶轴向模式。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/modal_analysis.rst:85
#: 0e556c3b748c4b4db1728f74a8925bb1
msgid "Tip displacement FRF with modal damping"
msgstr "含模态阻尼的尖端位移频响函数"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/modal_analysis.rst:90
#: 9ed9a9c694d74183adce2bfa3bfb91f7
msgid ""
"Dynamic amplification :math:`|u_x|/u_{\\text{static}}` at the tip — flat at "
"1 below the first resonance, peaking on each bending mode, dropping into "
"antiresonances between them."
msgstr ""
"尖端动态放大系数 :math:`|u_x|/u_{\\text{static}}`——第一共振频率以下平坦为 "
"1，在各弯曲模态处达到峰值，其间落入反共振谷。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/modal_analysis.rst:96
#: 74d176bfa33945d8abfb09be7aefc821
msgid "Running them"
msgstr "运行示例"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/modal_analysis.rst:103
#: aed51f42c6934b288c8d5fac4f72e972
msgid ""
"Both expose ``run_demo(...)`` plus geometry / mode-count / mesh-size flags "
"(``--help`` lists them). The eigensolves run through SciPy's shift-invert "
"Lanczos on the assembled sparse matrices — post-processing only, the "
"assembly core stays torch."
msgstr ""
"两者均提供 ``run_demo(...)`` 接口以及几何/模态数/网格尺寸参数（\\ ``--help`` 列出全部参数）。特征值求解通过 "
"SciPy 的位移-逆 Lanczos 方法在装配好的稀疏矩阵上运行——仅为后处理，装配核心保持 torch 不变。"

